 </span><span begin="00:51.114" end="00:51.409">tears </span><span begin="00:51.409" end="00:51.786">to </span><span begin="00:51.786" end="00:53.198">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.079" end="00:55.459"><span begin="00:54.079" end="00:54.663">Oh </span><span begin="00:54.663" end="00:55.459">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.459" end="00:57.432"><span begin="00:55.459" end="00:55.707">No </span><span begin="00:55.707" end="00:56.187">looking </span><span begin="00:56.187" end="00:56.987">back </span><span begin="00:56.987" end="00:57.212">this </span><span begin="00:57.212" end="00:57.432">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.459" end="01:12.410"><span begin="01:10.459" end="01:10.613">No </span><span begin="01:10.613" end="01:10.922">looking </span><span begin="01:10.922" end="01:11.605">back </span><span begin="01:11.605" end="01:11.929">this </span><span begin="01:11.929" end="01:12.410">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.416" end="01:26.983"><span begin="01:25.416" end="01:25.568">No </span><span begin="01:25.568" end="01:25.800">looking </span><span begin="01:25.800" end="01:26.328">back </span><span begin="01:26.328" end="01:26.673">this </span><span begin="01:26.673" end="01:26.983">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.982" end="01:41.848"><span begin="01:39.982" end="01:40.158">No </span><span begin="01:40.158" end="01:40.453">looking </span><span begin="01:40.453" end="01:41.182">back </span><span begin="01:41.182" end="01:41.448">this </span><span begin="01:41.448" end="01:41.848">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.486" end="01:47.893"><span begin="01:45.486" end="01:45.686">Running </span><span begin="01:45.686" end="01:45.934">from </span><span begin="01:45.934" end="01:46.150">the </span><span begin="01:46.150" end="01:46.453">truth </span><span begin="01:46.453" end="01:46.630">was </span><span begin="01:46.630" end="01:47.102">getting </span><span begin="01:47.102" end="01:47.893">reckles